From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:30:43 +0200
Subject: [ARCHEOLOGY] rockchip64: pmdomain: put only the clocks that were got

> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > On a deferred clock, rockchip_pm_add_one_domain() puts all clocks,
> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > including the error pointer, and clk_put() warns on every boot.
> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
> X-Git-Archeology: - Revision 814ab46114eb18832e18d1f94f2d279680a308d7: https://github.com/armbian/build/commit/814ab46114eb18832e18d1f94f2d279680a308d7
> X-Git-Archeology:   Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:30:43 +0200
> X-Git-Archeology:   From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
> X-Git-Archeology:   Subject: rockchip64: pmdomain: put only the clocks that were got
> X-Git-Archeology:
---
 drivers/pmdomain/rockchip/pm-domains.c | 11 +++++-----
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/pmdomain/rockchip/pm-domains.c b/drivers/pmdomain/rockchip/pm-domains.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/pmdomain/rockchip/pm-domains.c
+++ b/drivers/pmdomain/rockchip/pm-domains.c
@@ -819,11 +819,12 @@ static int rockchip_pm_add_one_domain(struct rockchip_pmu *pmu,
 	for (i = 0; i < pd->num_clks; i++) {
 		pd->clks[i].clk = of_clk_get(node, i);
 		if (IS_ERR(pd->clks[i].clk)) {
-			error = PTR_ERR(pd->clks[i].clk);
-			dev_err(pmu->dev,
-				"%pOFn: failed to get clk at index %d: %d\n",
-				node, i, error);
-			goto err_put_clocks;
+			error = dev_err_probe(pmu->dev, PTR_ERR(pd->clks[i].clk),
+					      "%pOFn: failed to get clk at index %d\n",
+					      node, i);
+			/* put only the clocks we got, not the error pointer */
+			clk_bulk_put(i, pd->clks);
+			return error;
 		}
 	}
 
